# VOICE-WEI - PROJECT RULES

## What this is

Voice-first music tools for one owner who practices hands-free (often while
driving). Live: https://fuseki.net/music8899b/

Tools (each is an `.html` + `.js` page sharing libraries): Scales, Intervals
(Ears), Phrases, Trace, Pitch, Music (AI player), Books (ebook/TTS).

Product intent: [docs/product-goals.md](docs/product-goals.md). Construction:
[docs/architecture.md](docs/architecture.md). Agent entry: [agents.md](agents.md).

## Keys and config

- **Claude / OpenAI API keys**: entered in the page Settings UI; stored in the
  browser via `api-keys-store.js` (localStorage). Never commit keys.
- **`config.json`** (gitignored; see `config.example.json`): local
  `./deploy.sh` credentials only. Production deploy uses GitHub Actions Secrets.
- Server does **not** need API keys in a file. `proxy.php` is Piped/Invidious
  search (+ URL read for Books); no Claude key on the server.

## Deploy (summary)

Push to `master` → Actions (typecheck, lint, fast tests) → rsync to fuseki.net.
Full rules: `.cursor/rules/10-deploy-workflow.mdc`. Version bump: once per
user-facing ship, same push as the change.

## Browser support

Chrome / Edge / Safari (Web Speech API). HTTPS required for microphone.
Firefox can browse; voice recognition is unsupported there.
